1
00:00:00,462 --> 00:00:01,862
(Sheldon:)because my university

2
00:00:01,864 --> 00:00:03,534
(Sheldon:)was making me do
string theory,

3
00:00:03,532 --> 00:00:06,032
(Sheldon:)and my favorite comic
book store burned down,

4
00:00:06,035 --> 00:00:07,905
and when my roommate
got engaged,

5
00:00:07,903 --> 00:00:10,173
(Sheldon:)my girlfriend wanted
to move in with me,

6
00:00:10,172 --> 00:00:12,842
(Sheldon:)which was no doubt
a ploy just to see my...

7
00:00:12,841 --> 00:00:15,241
(Sheldon:)Well, excuse my language,
but my bathing suit parts.

8
00:00:19,048 --> 00:00:21,048
(Sheldon:)Uh, sir, may I
use your phone?

9
00:00:21,050 --> 00:00:23,050
(Man:)I don't think so.
Yeah, well,

10
00:00:23,052 --> 00:00:24,882
(Sheldon:)I understand that
I'm half naked,

11
00:00:24,887 --> 00:00:26,757
(Sheldon:)but there is
a reasonable explanation.

12
00:00:26,755 --> 00:00:29,285
(Sheldon:)While I slept
in my sleeper car,

13
00:00:29,291 --> 00:00:31,091
(Sheldon:)all my possessions were stolen.

14
00:00:31,093 --> 00:00:32,093
(Sheldon:)Now,

15
00:00:32,094 --> 00:00:33,764
(Sheldon:)typically,
I wear pajamas,

16
00:00:33,762 --> 00:00:37,632
(Sheldon:)but I recently adopted
a hobo lifestyle

17
00:00:37,633 --> 00:00:41,273
and pajamas are the
sleep-pants of the Man.

18
00:00:43,372 --> 00:00:46,342
(Sheldon:)I'll have you know,
Mahatma Gandhi wore no pants

19
00:00:46,342 --> 00:00:48,242
and a nation rallied behind him!

20
00:00:48,243 --> 00:00:50,273
(Sheldon:)My good man...

21
00:00:50,279 --> 00:00:51,609
(Sheldon:)Now, before you walk away...

22
00:00:51,614 --> 00:00:53,514
(Sheldon:)I know that I may
appear deranged,

23
00:00:53,515 --> 00:00:55,985
(Sheldon:)but I am, in fact,
a world-renowned physicist.

24
00:00:55,985 --> 00:00:59,385
(Sheldon:)Ask me the difference
between a boson and a fermion.

25
00:00:59,388 --> 00:01:00,558
Go ahead, ask!

26
00:01:03,325 --> 00:01:05,195
(Sheldon:)Bosons have integer spin,

27
00:01:05,194 --> 00:01:07,624
fermions have half-integer spin!

28
00:01:07,630 --> 00:01:08,900
My legs are getting cold!

29
00:01:08,897 --> 00:01:11,797
(Sheldon:)Why won't anybody help me?

